<title>UK: S&amp;P puts KPN ratings on CreditWatch.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P puts KPN ratings on CreditWatch.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rating agency Standard &amp; Poor's said on Thursday it had placed Koninklijke PTT Netherland NV's (KPN) ratings on CreditWatch with negative implications.</p>
<p>&quot;The CreditWatch placement follows KPN's recent announcement that it will be splitting its telecommunications and postal operations,&quot; S&amp;P said in a statement.</p>
<p>S&amp;P said it will review the implications of this announcement with KPN's management as soon as full details were available.</p>
<p>&quot;A final resolution of the CreditWatch status is not expected before the end of 1997,&quot; S&amp;P said.  </p>
<p>Ratings placed on CreditWatch with the negative implications.</p>
<p>    Senior unsecured debt	   AA plus</p>
<p>    Issuer credit rating	    AA plus</p>
<p>    Subordinated debt		 AA</p>
<p>    Short-term debt		   A1 plus</p>
<p>--International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 4041</p>
</text>
